Subject: [PATCH] Artwork picked the Kodi way

Backdrops without text come first (a title printed on the backdrop
fights with the UI drawn over it), posters in the user's language, then
English, then textless. Ratings are weighted by their vote count so a
single 10/10 vote no longer wins.
